\n先生の感性のままに自由に描いていただければ幸いです。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/152ZaqD_4aGl1HuCwgV7BuD-9VFB5tGuO?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@guruminnSuB/works/1115", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c9fb3c33/uploads/origins/162155bd-a2f6-4351-adb8-755ab5f13ce2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfaacc1d81786aa2118efe04ff8eb41c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c9fb3c33/uploads/origins/162155bd-a2f6-4351-adb8-755ab5f13ce2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfaacc1d81786aa2118efe04ff8eb41c, https://si.imgix.net/c9fb3c33/uploads/origins/162155bd-a2f6-4351-adb8-755ab5f13ce2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2876e7b3b2fb9eff131c3b9df2d2b2ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c9fb3c33/uploads/origins/162155bd-a2f6-4351-adb8-755ab5f13ce2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9dcdd648be6915aef7c3850e891e858 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "二人のイラストが必要です。内容は過去のイラストと同様で、ポーズは自由に設定してください。設定図は参考URLをご参照ください。脚は動物のような曲がった脚ではなく、まっすぐな脚が望ましいです。衣装は設定図に準じてください。https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NIrhFjS3wFNSxXQuIQ_l71ej2HAsN10Z?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@guruminnSuB/works/1114", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/12c0a6ed/uploads/origins/1513641f-2ec1-4002-b10b-e1c8aa794b45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c5d9613911a0f9e96710f6a3cbffc96", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/12c0a6ed/uploads/origins/1513641f-2ec1-4002-b10b-e1c8aa794b45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c5d9613911a0f9e96710f6a3cbffc96, https://si.imgix.net/12c0a6ed/uploads/origins/1513641f-2ec1-4002-b10b-e1c8aa794b45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&