82", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8a6ea2f9/uploads/origins/4a4ef39b-557f-4cbe-b360-f4d665b775ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1564eadac5b9aa68d1c2bb9de7aaa682, https://si.imgix.net/8a6ea2f9/uploads/origins/4a4ef39b-557f-4cbe-b360-f4d665b775ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbc43eb357193120996cca52e78b8b2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8a6ea2f9/uploads/origins/4a4ef39b-557f-4cbe-b360-f4d665b775ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a73ae4b09618ff55d6bc2d3961057a4b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I really love the previous illustration you did for me—it was so adorable! \n\nI’d love to commission you again. Could you draw my Purple Wolf OC this time?\n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XD-fI7zKaUkbU2_NH-Vw72vKTXx4giP3\n\nHe is a little bit shy. Other the same, any pose or details are fine! \n\nThanks so much, can't wait to see it! ✨", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@guruminnSuB/works/1111", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/180a1dc3/uploads/origins/6931e079-371f-4c7c-870b-5bd098af460a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=654a7cac664ab3b7cba83de09bfd8fb6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/180a1dc3/uploads/origins/6931e079-371f-4c7c-870b-5bd098af460a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=654a7cac664ab3b7cba83de09bfd8fb6, https://si.imgix.net/180a1dc3/uploads/origins/6931e079-371f-4c7c-870b-5bd098af460a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72fe742cdf59cc8eae3e73b4bc40b8b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/180a1dc3/uploads/origins/6931e079-371f-4c7c-870b-5bd098af460a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4e5dc0e8b6cc529730d9f4ef17d7e56 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师您好！您的作品非常可爱，我超级喜欢，希望您能接受我的委托～\n我希望您能用我的oc画一份类似于您展示的插图，可以给我的oc配一件可爱的小水手服，然后希望能坐在地上露出肉垫～\n非常感谢！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1bIjZ5U3Ds04EjNYSKE3dVDiedD5-ctUD/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@guruminnSuB/works/1110", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/17a64a22/uploads/origins/419e598a-8649-47c1-9365-aa5ec1d0ae1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91a416ba22aa21f0dac02785ece0843e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17a64a22/uploads/origins/419e598a-8649-47c1-9365-aa5ec1d0ae1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91a416ba22aa21f0dac02785ece0843e, https://si.imgix.net/17a64a22/uploads/origins/419e598a-8649-47c1-9365-aa5ec1d0ae1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7815ce0b054ac90f9aa50e8ca08428cf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17a64a22/uploads/origins/419e598a-8649-47c1-9365-aa5ec1d0ae1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7702052001bb6eef70a6859b27a5365a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生\n初めてSkebでリクエストを提出しましたので、申請の流れがはっきり分からなくなってしまいまして\n\nフルソナ（ケモキャラ）は狼の子でございまして、動き（動作とか）先生によってお決めしてくださいませ。\n\n唯一の要求ですけれども、フルソナの詳細が違わなければ平気でございます。注意点なんですけれども、火の小精霊でございます。それで、尻尾も火焔（炎）ですし、目の中にある火焔の描かないといけません。\nすこと、まず御礼申し上げます。\n\n敬具\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1CfmrX7tYrbkjVVAIXv6KPx_NTmheRirQ/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@guruminnSuB/works/1109", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bcacce66/uploads/origins/55a39b93-4b93-4fde-833e-1aea7d2fc1b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a71add6e0ef805362fcc98623df094e1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bcacce66/uploads/origins/55a39b93-4b93-4fde-833e-1aea7d2fc1b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=2